{"seq":60,"slug":"state-space-models-mamba","title":"状态空间模型与 Mamba","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"状态空间模型与-mamba-总览\">状态空间模型与 Mamba·总览</h1><p>2024 年初 Mamba 论文发布时，社区第一次认真讨论「Transformer 之外还有别的主干吗」。到 2026 年，答案已经不再是猜测：NVIDIA 的 Nemotron-H、Nemotron Nano 2 与 Nemotron-3，AI21 的 Jamba，Zyphra 的 Zamba2，都把 Mamba-2 风格的状态空间层当成生产级 LLM 的核心计算单元，并在长上下文吞吐上拿到了相对纯注意力数倍的优势。这个 hub 要讲清楚的，正是这条从经典控制论里的线性系统，一路演化到今天混合架构主干的完整脉络。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 按四条主线递进，互相之间是「地基→承重墙→使用场景→施工经验」的关系，不是平行罗列。</p>\n<p>第一条线是<strong>基础</strong>。它回答两个问题：为什么人们要在 Transformer 之外另起炉灶，以及状态空间模型到底是什么。答案藏在复杂度里——注意力对序列长度是平方级的，而一个携带固定大小隐状态、随时间线性推进的系统是线性级的。我们会从连续时间线性系统的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A,B,C,D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 四个矩阵讲起，再讲离散化怎么把它变成既能像 RNN 那样逐步递归、又能像 CNN 那样一次性卷积的双重形态。</p>\n<p>第二条线是<strong>架构</strong>。基础形态有个致命问题：固定不变的状态转移矩阵让模型无法「选择性地记住或遗忘」。S4 用结构化参数化解决了把这个系统训练稳定、算得够快的工程难题；Mamba 进一步让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B,C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 和步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 依赖于输入，赋予模型内容感知的选择能力；而硬件感知并行扫描内核，则是让选择性 SSM 真正跑得比注意力快的那块底层拼图。</p>\n<p>第三条线是<strong>应用</strong>。有了能跑的架构，自然要问它擅长什么、不擅长什么。长序列建模是它的主场，但精确检索与上下文内复制是它的软肋——这恰恰是 2026 年所有主流模型都走向「注意力混合 SSM」的根本原因。我们还会走出语言，看视觉、音频、基因组这些天然长序列的领域里 SSM 的表现。</p>\n<p>第四条线是<strong>实践</strong>。它沉淀工程经验：训练时怎么让递归不发散、初始化怎么设，怎样在同等算力下对 Transformer 做公平对比而不是田忌赛马，以及 Mamba-3 之后仍然敞开的研究问题。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：本 hub 只讲状态空间模型这一条架构家族。注意力机制本身、Transformer 的完整原理，属于 <a href=\"../llm-fundamentals/\">LLM 基础</a>；通用的深度学习训练与正则化属于 <a href=\"../deep-learning/\">深度学习</a>；推理部署、KV 缓存、批调度等服务侧工程属于 <a href=\"../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">LLM 服务与推理系统</a>；量化、剪枝、蒸馏等压缩手段属于 <a href=\"../model-compression-inference/\">模型压缩与推理优化</a>。本 hub 提到这些时只点到为止并链接过去，不重复展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>。如果你是想快速判断「要不要在项目里用 SSM」的工程师，先读基础章的 <a href=\"foundations/sequence-modeling-landscape\">序列建模格局</a>，再直接跳到 <a href=\"practice/benchmarks-vs-transformers\">与 Transformer 的对比</a> 和 <a href=\"applications/hybrid-attention-ssm\">注意力混合架构</a>。如果你想真正理解原理，请按章节顺序通读：基础→架构→应用→实践。如果你做的是非语言模态（图像、音频、生物序列），基础读完后可直奔 <a href=\"applications/ssm-beyond-language\">跨模态应用</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：线性代数（矩阵乘法、特征值、对角化）、对 RNN 与注意力机制的基本认识、能读懂 KaTeX 写的微分方程与差分方程。具备这些，本 hub 的每一篇都能顺畅读下来。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sequence-modeling-landscape","title":"序列建模格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/foundations/sequence-modeling-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ssm-fundamentals","title":"状态空间模型基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/foundations/ssm-fundamentals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"discretization-recurrence","title":"离散化与递归形式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/foundations/discretization-recurrence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectures","title":"架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"s4-structured-ssm","title":"S4 结构化状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/s4-structured-ssm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mamba-selective-ssm","title":"Mamba 选择性状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/mamba-selective-ssm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hardware-aware-parallel-scan","title":"硬件感知并行扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/hardware-aware-parallel-scan"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"long-sequence-modeling","title":"长序列建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/applications/long-sequence-modeling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hybrid-attention-ssm","title":"注意力混合架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/applications/hybrid-attention-ssm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ssm-beyond-language","title":"跨模态应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/applications/ssm-beyond-language"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"training-stability-tricks","title":"训练稳定性技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/practice/training-stability-tricks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"benchmarks-vs-transformers","title":"与 Transformer 的对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/practice/benchmarks-vs-transformers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ssm-research-frontier","title":"研究前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/practice/ssm-research-frontier"}]}]}